WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.500
<v You>You：Excuse me…

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:05.802
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Ah, you've come. I've been waiting.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:06.600
<v You>You：The cask, as promised.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:11.300
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Come, sit there. Tonight is my banquet.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.426
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：Welcome. We are honoured you came.

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:20.379
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：I, Ieyasu, shall keep you company tonight.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.908
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：So stiff, Ieyasu.

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:31.218
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：First, a cup of warm sake. …See the steam rising?

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.111
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Right — let us all drink! Kanpai!

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:37.800
<v You>You：Cheers!

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:39.900
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Ha ha ha!

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:42.650
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：What's this? Surely you can drink more?

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:46.629
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：Don't push yourself. Just a sip, to start.

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:50.176
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：Ho ho ho.

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:50.900
<v You>You：…Just a sip, then.

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:55.336
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：…Come closer. I'll tell you alone.

00:00:55.800 --> 00:01:00.159
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：I am looking past this land — to what lies beyond.

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:01.600
<v You>You：Beyond…?

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:06.108
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：And this is chilled sake, kept on ice.

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:12.390
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：…For all his bluster, Lord Nobunaga gets lonely.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:17.981
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：So stay with him tonight, at your ease.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:22.493
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：What are you two whispering about?

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:26.803
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：Oh… the wind has grown strong.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:30.514
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：……Something feels wrong.

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:35.034
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：Do not worry. It is only the night wind.

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:41.877
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Hmph. A little wind won't end my banquet.

00:01:41.900 --> 00:01:45.089
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Ha!

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:49.829
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：Rain. …Let me add more charcoal.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:53.600
<v You>You：…So warm.

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:58.458
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：…Listen to the rain. Not bad, is it?

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.529
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：A night like this never comes twice.

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:05.463
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Heh heh heh…

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:08.200
<v You>You：…I wish I could stay here forever.

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:12.405
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：The rain is letting up.

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:18.263
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：One last cup. You too — take yours.

00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:22.590
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：…I shall never forget this night.

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:27.415
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Mm. …Let us drink again.

00:02:26.900 --> 00:02:29.700
<v You>You：Yes — I promise.
